Problem: Permutation in String (LC 567)

Pattern: Fixed Size Sliding Window + Frequency Array

Approach:

If s1 is longer than s2, return false.
Create two frequency arrays of size 26:
freq1 for s1
freq2 for the current window in s2
Fill both arrays for the first window of length s1.length().
Compare the frequency arrays.
Slide the window:
Remove the outgoing character.
Add the incoming character.
Compare the frequency arrays after each slide.
If they ever match, return true.
Otherwise, return false.

Time Complexity: O(n)

Space Complexity: O(1) (the frequency arrays always have size 26)